# WizardCastClanBuffCurseStoneAggressive (21338, level 80), every draw 0, for a character with no alliance hitting from 300
# away. Its parent runs before and after its own part: the character fills its hate list and draws the long range DD
# magic twice (weight 2000000). The first hit, above half of its HP, wants both buffs on itself and sets int slot 2, and
# wants its debuff on its most hated attacker, all weight 1000000.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.Wizard.Wizard
